# Copie para secrets/github-mcp.env (gitignored) e preencha.
# Carregado pelo ~/.zshrc; usado pelo MCP remoto do GitHub
# (https://api.githubcopilot.com/mcp/) nos 3 harnesses:
#   - Claude Code: plugin github@claude-plugins-official (Authorization: Bearer ${GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN})
#   - Codex: bearer_token_env_var = "GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN"
#   - OpenCode: "Authorization": "Bearer {env:GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN}"
# O servidor hospedado não aceita OAuth desses clientes; use um fine-grained PAT com o
# mínimo necessário (Contents, Issues, Pull requests: read/write nos repos que usar):
# https://github.com/settings/personal-access-tokens/new
export GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN=
